___NOTES___

Okito CMP — Google Tag Manager Community Template.
Mirrors Okito's CDN Consent Mode defaults: opt-in regions denied
(wait_for_update from "Wait for update"), everywhere else granted
(wait_for_update 0) unless "Measurement off until a choice" is selected;
functionality_storage and
security_storage always granted.
The Okito CDN script (https://cdn.okito.com/js/{websiteKey}) renders the banner
and issues gtag('consent','update', ...) on a visitor's choice, and a denied
update when the browser sends Global Privacy Control.
